  message: "Fixed in PR #2151 (merged). measure-taint-precision.py run_verify_claims and measure-go-import-versioning.py run_arm now save the production globals they rebind and restore them in try/finally. Behavioral evidence: the filed repro, smart-test -n 0 -p no:randomly tests/test_measure_taint_precision.py packages/hypergumbo-core/tests/test_verify_claims.py::TestViolatedFlowEvidence, went from 1 failed / 19 passed to 23 passed (exit 0). New restore tests fail against the unfixed scripts (2 failed, 1 passed each) and pass with the fix. Scope: the two scripts named; the other measure-* scripts swept already restore in try/finally."  # 7418
